msgid "expedition.ui.enter"
msgstr "探索商场"
msgid "expedition.ui.enter_short"
msgstr "探索"
msgid "expedition.ui.confirm_enter"
msgstr "一旦离开中庭，今夜将在商场中连续探索两个房间。现在出发吗？"

msgid "expedition.ui.confirm_enter.lethal_white_flower"
msgstr "我已经有三朵白花。如果离开这里，或许我将万劫不复。"

msgid "expedition.ui.confirm_enter.lethal_wound"
msgstr "我已经有三道伤口。如果离开这里，或许我将万劫不复。"
msgid "expedition.ui.door_prompt"
msgstr "你选择的门将决定你接下来六小时在哪里度过……"
msgid "expedition.ui.unknown"
msgstr "通往未知"
msgid "expedition.ui.continue"
msgstr "继续"
msgid "expedition.ui.submit"
msgstr "提交"
msgid "expedition.ui.confirm"
msgstr "确认"
msgid "expedition.ui.sell"
msgstr "出售"
msgid "expedition.ui.leave"
msgstr "离开房间"
msgid "expedition.ui.next_round"
msgstr "继续深入"
msgid "expedition.ui.demo_complete"
msgstr "扫描结束。Demo 到此结束。"
msgid "expedition.ui.placeholder.intro"
msgstr "房间图像（占位）"
msgid "expedition.ui.placeholder.challenge"
msgstr "挑战图像（占位）"
msgid "expedition.ui.placeholder.response"
msgstr "对策图像（占位）"
msgid "expedition.ui.placeholder.result"
msgstr "结果图像（占位）"

msgid "expedition.feedback.enough"
msgstr "足够了。"
msgid "expedition.feedback.maybe"
msgstr "或许可以。"
msgid "expedition.feedback.hopeless"
msgstr "完全不行。"

msgid "expedition.approach.observe.title"
msgstr "停下来调查"
msgid "expedition.approach.observe.text"
msgstr "你让呼吸慢下来，仔细辨认黑暗里每一种微小的秩序。"
msgid "expedition.approach.advance.title"
msgstr "径直向前"
msgid "expedition.approach.advance.text"
msgstr "你决定在它察觉之前穿过去；或者至少表现得像是如此。"
msgid "expedition.room.common.challenge.1"
msgstr "某种东西挡住了出口。"
msgid "expedition.room.common.challenge.2"
msgstr "它不理解勇气，却可能理解清醒而明确的行动。"
msgid "expedition.room.common.post_choice"
msgstr "把你愿意依靠的东西放在这里。"
msgid "expedition.room.common.success"
msgstr "那道阻碍迟疑了一瞬。你抓住这一瞬，从它身旁通过。"
msgid "expedition.room.common.failure"
msgstr "你的办法没有奏效。黑暗赶在你之前合拢。"
msgid "expedition.room.rest.result"
msgstr "你在这里停留片刻。某种被忽略的自己重新长出了一点。"
msgid "expedition.room.rest.empty_result"
msgstr "你没有休息，只是继续在这里徘徊。后来，你拾起了一些银色的东西。 [+20]"
msgid "expedition.room.salvage.result"
msgstr "机器吞下这些东西，吐出仍然有效的钱。"

msgid "expedition.room.spaceship_library_city.name"
msgstr "飞船图书城"
msgid "expedition.room.spaceship_library_city.intro.1"
msgstr "书架像停泊的飞船，一排排悬在没有尽头的夜里。"
msgid "expedition.room.spaceship_library_city.intro.2"
msgstr "书页自行翻动，寻找一个尚未写下的读者。"
msgid "expedition.room.gray_hall.name"
msgstr "灰色大厅"
msgid "expedition.room.gray_hall.intro.1"
msgstr "这里的灯把所有颜色都磨成了灰。"
msgid "expedition.room.gray_hall.intro.2"
msgstr "广播反复播送一个无人记得的闭店时间。"
msgid "expedition.room.birthday_party.name"
msgstr "生日派对"
msgid "expedition.room.birthday_party.intro.1"
msgstr "生日蜡烛在没有蛋糕的桌上燃烧，火焰一齐朝向你。"
msgid "expedition.room.birthday_party.intro.2"
msgstr "纸帽下的空椅子正在等待最后一位客人。"

msgid "expedition.room.retro_restaurant.name"
msgstr "复古餐厅"
msgid "expedition.room.retro_restaurant.intro.1"
msgstr "红色卡座还留着上一桌客人的温度。"
msgid "expedition.room.retro_restaurant.intro.2"
msgstr "菜单建议你用一顿饭换取片刻安稳。"
msgid "expedition.room.home.name"
msgstr "家"
msgid "expedition.room.home.intro.1"
msgstr "门后是一间不属于任何地址的家。"
msgid "expedition.room.home.intro.2"
msgstr "你可以留下某样东西，假装自己真的回来过。"
msgid "expedition.room.rainforest.name"
msgstr "雨林"
msgid "expedition.room.rainforest.intro.1"
msgstr "潮湿叶片从商场裂缝里长出，遮住了天花板。"
msgid "expedition.room.rainforest.intro.2"
msgstr "让一种已有的面相走进去；雨会让它再长高一点。"
msgid "expedition.room.salvage_yard.name"
msgstr "回收站"
msgid "expedition.room.salvage_yard.intro.1"
msgstr "秤盘、传送带和一只永远张开的铁口。"
msgid "expedition.room.salvage_yard.intro.2"
msgstr "它不询问来历，只承认东西原本的价钱。"

msgid "expedition.room.shelf_shift.name"
msgstr "货架"
msgid "expedition.room.shelf_shift.intro.1"
msgstr "今夜的货架比白天更长，也比白天更饿。"
msgid "expedition.room.shelf_shift.intro.2"
msgstr "把商品推回它们的位置，雨林小组会付你二十块。"

msgid "expedition.room.scanner.name"
msgstr "扫描员"
msgid "expedition.room.scanner.intro.1"
msgstr "一束红光从天花板降下，像一只缓慢睁开的眼睛。"
msgid "expedition.room.scanner.intro.2"
msgstr "它已经认出你不是商品，也不是顾客。"
msgid "expedition.room.scanner.challenge.1"
msgstr "扫描开始。你必须连续两次证明自己有权通过。"
msgid "expedition.room.scanner.challenge.2"
msgstr "红光正在学习你的轮廓。"
msgid "expedition.room.scanner.post_choice"
msgstr "保持清醒。不要让它替你说出名字。"
msgid "expedition.room.scanner.success"
msgstr "红光偏离了一点。扫描员第一次没有读懂你。"
msgid "expedition.room.scanner.failure"
msgstr "扫描完成。你被商场吐回安全区，身上多了一道错误的条码。"

msgid "expedition.reward.salvage.name"
msgstr "拾得物"
msgid "expedition.reward.salvage.description"
msgstr "从房间角落拾来的东西。它仍值八块钱，也许这就是它唯一清楚的来历。"
msgid "expedition.reward.wound.name"
msgstr "伤口"
msgid "expedition.reward.wound.description"
msgstr "我的心脏上多了一道伤口，从中流出了凝固的水泥。[累计三个，游戏就会结束。你需要休息，或在袋中想想办法。]"
msgid "expedition.reward.wage.name"
msgstr "工资 +20"
msgid "expedition.reward.wage.description"
msgstr "六小时被折成二十块钱。雨林小组从不询问你在货架深处看见了什么。"

msgid "expedition.disease.white_flower.name"
msgstr "白花"
msgid "expedition.disease.white_flower.description"
msgstr "我的喉咙发痒，我知道那里正长出花朵，它们终有一天会穿透颅骨，在我的头顶盛放。[累计3个，游戏就会结束。你需要直面挑战，或在袋中想想办法。]"
msgid "expedition.property.disease.name"
msgstr "病症"
msgid "expedition.property.disease.description"
msgstr "一种正在我身上累积的变化。[病症只能放入袋中合成台的原料槽。]"
msgid "expedition.recipe.clear_white_flower.name"
msgstr "消除白花"
msgid "expedition.recipe.clear_white_flower.hint"
msgstr "花还没有穿透骨头。理性可以辨清它的根，共情可以记起它尚未存在的时候。"
msgid "expedition.recipe.base.white_flower"
msgstr "一朵白花"
msgid "expedition.recipe.clear_white_flower.process.1"
msgstr "花根在袋底寻找一条并不存在的血管。"
msgid "expedition.recipe.clear_white_flower.process.2"
msgstr "我叫出它的颜色，或记起没有它的喉咙。白花因此枯萎。"
msgid "expedition.recipe.clear_wound.name"
msgstr "消除伤口"
msgid "expedition.recipe.clear_wound.hint"
msgstr "水泥还没有完全凝固。安歇可以合拢裂口，幻觉可以令它忘记自己的形状。"
msgid "expedition.recipe.base.wound"
msgstr "一道伤口"
msgid "expedition.recipe.clear_wound.process.1"
msgstr "伤口张开嘴，吐出一小块灰色的城市。"
msgid "expedition.recipe.clear_wound.process.2"
msgstr "我让它睡去，或让它梦见自己从未裂开。水泥停止流动。"
msgid "expedition.ui.disease_end.white_flower"
msgstr "白花终于穿透颅骨，在我的头顶盛放。\n今晚的探索尚未开始，游戏已经结束。"
msgid "expedition.ui.disease_end.expedition_wound"
msgstr "第三道伤口贯穿心脏，凝固的水泥填满了纸袋。\n今晚的探索尚未开始，游戏已经结束。"
